cff-version: 1.2.0
title: als_eff_meas
message: If you use this software, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McCoy
    given-names: Jake A.
    email: jam1117@psu.edu
    affiliation: The Pennsylvania State University
repository-code: https://github.com/jamccoy/als_eff_meas
abstract: >-
  Reduction of Advanced Light Source beamline scans to grating diffraction
  efficiency for gratings in the extreme off-plane (conical) mount at grazing
  incidence, where diffracted orders fall on an arc rather than a line. Fits the
  diffraction arc, recovers the mount geometry (cone half-angle, azimuthal
  incidence, roll, graze and yaw) from the fitted arc and the direct and
  zero-order beam positions, and measures absolute efficiency per order per
  photon energy with full uncertainty propagation.
keywords:
  - diffraction grating
  - diffraction efficiency
  - synchrotron
  - x-ray optics
  - off-plane mount
  - conical diffraction
  - Advanced Light Source
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
